keywords:
  - official statistics
  - Statistical Performance Indicators
  - World Bank
  - Uzbekistan
  - reproducibility
  - data validation
abstract: >
  A fully reproducible verification package for the World Bank Statistical
  Performance Indicators (SPI) figures for Uzbekistan (2016-2024), including
  an executable Python notebook, a structured numerical claims register, and
  an interactive HTML dashboard, all pinned to World Bank SPI release v4.0
  (commit 2dd02f746cb4e2159281adc74d6865f948e90ce1).
